{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0010_0010", "id": "ko_004_0010_0010_0001", "offset": 1, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『일주서(逸周書)』의 가장 오래된 주석은 서진(西晉) 시기 오경박사(五經博士)였던 공조(孔鼂)의 것으로(周寶宏, 2001, 『《逸周書》考釋』 (高翔 編, 前沿書系), 北京: 社會科學文獻出版社, 9쪽; 張懷通, 2013, 『《逸周書》新硏』 (國家社科基金後期資助項目), 北京: 中華書局, 4-6쪽), 원문의 본주(本注)는 이 공조의 주석을 따랐다. 역대 주석가들의 주석은 모두 黃懷信, 張懋鎔, 田旭東 著, 黃懷信, 李學勤 編, 2007 『逸周書彙校集注(修訂本)』 (中華要籍集釋叢書), 上海: 上海古籍出版社를 참고하였다.", "type": "번역주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 13, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "孔鼂云: 受天大命以改殷. 天明命王天□也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 26, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "孔鼂云: 爲三監, 監殷人.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 50, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "孔鼂云: 紂所拘囚者也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0020_0010", "id": "ko_004_0020_0010_0001", "offset": 314, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "□: 본래 빠져있는 곳으로, 청나라 건융(乾隆) 연간 왕모(王謨)가 집간(輯刊)한 『增訂漢魏叢書』에서 ‘采’로 보충하였으나, 유월(兪樾)은 ‘⾤’, 즉 ‘蕃’으로 석독하였다. “9번지국(九蕃之國)”은 9주(九州) 바깥의 번국(蕃國)을 가리킨다(黃懷信, 張懋鎔, 田旭東 著, 2007, 『逸周書彙校集注(修訂本)』, 715쪽).", "type": "번역주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": "ko_004_0030_0010_0001", "offset": 16, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "𡽙 王應麟은 ‘𣰌’, 즉 ‘鬣’으로 석독하였다(黃懷信, 張懋鎔, 田旭東 著, 2007, 『逸周書彙校集注(修訂本)』, 818-819쪽). 말의 갈기를 뜻한다.", "type": "번역주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 23, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "孔鼂云: 周公主東方則太公主西方, 東靑馬則西白馬矣. 馬名未聞.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "孔鼂云: 戟也. 各異方.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 46, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "孔鼂云: 正比, 內臺北也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 52, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "孔鼂云: 稷愼, 肅愼也. 貢䴤似鹿.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 75, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "孔鼂云: 穢, 韓穢, 東夷別種.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 106, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "孔鼂云: 良夷, 樂浪之夷也. 貢奇獸.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 121, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "孔鼂云: 亦奇魚也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 134, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "孔鼂云: 發亦東夷, 迅, 疾.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 140, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "孔鼂云: 兪, 東北夷. 雖馬, 舊駕, 一角. 大者曰麟也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 147, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "孔鼂云: 靑丘, 海東地名.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 160, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "孔鼂云: 周頭亦海東名也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 169, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 13, "text": "孔鼂云: 黑齒, 西遠之夷也. 貢白鹿·白馬.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 188, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 14, "text": "孔鼂云: 白民亦東南夷.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 7, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "孔鼂云: 夷, 東比夷也. 采生火中, 色黑面光, 其堅若鐵也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "孔鼂云: 康亦西戎別名也. 食稃苡卽有身.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 68, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "孔鼂云: 州靡, 北狄也. 費費曰梟羊, 好行立, 行如人, 被髮, 前足稍長者也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 85, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "孔鼂云: 都郭, 北狄. 生生, 二名也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 115, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "孔鼂云: 奇幹亦北狄. 善芳, 鳥名. 不昧, 不□也. 皆東, 東向列次也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 139, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "孔鼂云: 高夷, 東北夷 高句驪.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 152, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "孔鼂云: 獨鹿, 西方之戎也. 邛邛, 獸似距虛, 負厥而走也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 158, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "孔鼂云: 孤竹, 東北狄. 距虛, 獸也, 驢騾之屬.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 165, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "孔鼂云: 不令支, 皆東北夷. 模, 白狐. 玄模, 則黑狐也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 172, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "孔鼂云: 不屠何亦東北夷也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 178, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "孔鼂云: 東胡, 東北西卑.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 183, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "孔鼂云: 山戎亦東北夷. 戎菽, 荳藥也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 60, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "孔鼂云: 十者, 東夷·蠻越之別稱. 鬋髮·文身, 因其事以名也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 82, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "孔鼂云: 鞞, 刀削. 鰂, 魚名. 瞂, 盾也, 以鮫皮作之. 鮫, 文魚也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 127, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "孔鼂云: 十二者, 北狄之別名也. 戎狄在西北界, 戎狄之間國名也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 41, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "孔鼂云: 此在《周官·大司馬》下篇, 穆王使有司抄出之, 欲時省焉. 國邑曰鄙. 東方曰夷, 南方曰蠻, 皆狄蠻之別. 貉, 夷之別, 八·七·九·五·六, 見非一之言也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 75, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "孔鼂云: 貫, 事.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_004_ko_004_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 145, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "孔鼂云: 四擾, 牛·馬·羊·豖. 三種, 黍·稷·稻也.", "type": "원주"}
